@ MESO (the DEVON employee you save in PETALBURG WOODS, then help in RUSTBORO). He was LARPING in the
@ woods, has a SMASH tournament to get to (that's the hurry), and TEAM BEANIE's thief took his
@ SWITCH along with the DEVON GOODS. ZAABY got him the job, so ZAABY is going to kill him. After you
@ save him, he asks you to add him on SPOTIFY.

@@ file: data/maps/PetalburgWoods/scripts.inc
PetalburgWoods_Text_NotAOneToBeFound:
	.string "Hmmm…\n"
	.string "Where did my LARP party go…$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_HaveYouSeenShroomish:
	.string "Hello! I'm MESO.\p"
	.string "I was LARPING out here. Elf ranger.\n"
	.string "Have you seen the rest of my party?$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_HandOverThosePapers:
	.string "You! DEVON guy!\p"
	.string "Hand over that bag!$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_YouHaveToHelpMe:
	.string "MESO: Aiyeeeh!\p"
	.string "You're a POKéMON TRAINER, aren't you?\n"
	.string "You've got to help me, please!$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_ThatWasAwfullyClose:
	.string "MESO: Whew…\n"
	.string "That was awfully close!\p"
	.string "My DEVON papers are safe.\n"
	.string "And my SWITCH, too!\p"
	.string "I have a SMASH tournament later.\n"
	.string "Can't lose my SWITCH.\p"
	.string "Hey, add me on SPOTIFY! Then you\n"
	.string "can see what I'm listening to.\p"
	.string "And here's a GREAT BALL as\n"
	.string "my thanks!$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_TeamAquaAfterSomethingInRustboro:
	.string "MESO: Didn't that TEAM BEANIE thug say\n"
	.string "they were after something in\l"
	.string "RUSTBORO, too?$"

PetalburgWoods_Text_ICantBeWastingTime:
	.string "MESO: Uh-oh! I can't be wasting time!\n"
	.string "SMASH tournament!$"

@@ file: data/maps/RustboroCity/scripts.inc
RustboroCity_Text_WaitDontTakeMyGoods:
	.string "MESO: Wait! Pleeeaaase!\p"
	.string "Don't take my SWITCH!\n"
	.string "And the GOODS!$"

RustboroCity_Text_HelpMeIWasRobbed:
	.string "MESO: Oh, it's you! From PETALBURG\n"
	.string "WOODS!\p"
	.string "TEAM BEANIE robbed me! They took\n"
	.string "the DEVON GOODS…\p"
	.string "…and my SWITCH was in the bag!\p"
	.string "I have a SMASH tournament tonight.\n"
	.string "I'm in such a hurry!\p"
	.string "And ZAABY got me this job.\n"
	.string "ZAABY is going to kill me.$"

RustboroCity_Text_YouGotItThankYou:
	.string "MESO: Oh! How did it go?\p"
	.string "You got the GOODS back!\n"
	.string "And my SWITCH! You're the best!\p"
	.string "ZAABY won't kill me, and I can make\n"
	.string "my SMASH tournament!\p"
	.string "Here's another GREAT BALL!\n"
	.string "And add me on SPOTIFY!$"
